{#- Claude Code reads project hooks ONLY from settings files. A plain project's
    `.claude/hooks/hooks.json` is NOT a hook-config location — that path is valid
    for a PLUGIN bundle only (hooks.md's location table). Confirmed by controlled
    experiment 2026-07-17: the same commands fired from settings.json and not from
    `.claude/hooks/hooks.json`, in the same session and repo.

    ADR-006 staging (PLAN-permission-deny-and-hooks-wiring):
      Stage 1 (Phase 1) — non-blocking: telemetry, post_write_reminder,
        sessionid_envfile, autopilot_autoarm, flush_session.
      Stage 2 (Phase 2) — control-flow, **Stop event only**: loop_gate, passing
        `--mode stop-hook` (the module dispatches on it). loop_gate on Stop is what
        lets /hm:loop reach iteration 2. Stop-blocking
        is a materially lower risk class than tool-call blocking: it cannot block a
        tool call, it is bounded by each module's stop_hook_active guard, and the
        worst case is one extra turn.
      Stage 3 (Phase 3) — everything that can block an ORDINARY TOOL CALL:
        permission_gate, worktree_gate, spec_gate. They land last, with a live
        negative control, and atomically with ADR-007's
        `--subordinate-to-deny-dangerous` flag.

    The staging axis is the EVENT, not the module (REVIEW round 1, consensus P1 —
    codex + code-reviewer).

    NOTE (PLAN-autopilot-advance-noop Phase 4): this block used to reason at length about
    where `autopilot_guard` belonged. That module was deleted in 539f05a9 and its
    invocations are retired from every rendered surface; `render._HARNESS_RETIRED_HOOK_
    INVOCATIONS` still strips it from an existing user's settings.json on re-render. Do
    not reintroduce it here — a reference to a module that does not exist is worse than
    no reference.

    Stage 3 IS wired here now (Phase 3 redo, after the parked attempt's Grade-D review).
    The `PreToolUse` key carries the blocking gates on matchers `Bash` and
    `Write|Edit|MultiEdit`. Of the two P0s that sank the parked attempt, only #1 still has
    a live subject — #2 concerned the now-deleted `autopilot_guard`'s permission-surface
    write detection and died with the module.
    (P0 #1) `.claude/hooks/hooks.json` is retired: its FileSpec is removed (synthesize.py)
    and it no longer renders; a byte-pristine stale copy is deleted, a user-edited one
    preserved (reconcile `_SWEEP_NEVER_DELETE` + cli pristine-exact-match).
    spec_gate uses `Write|Edit|MultiEdit`. The `Write|Edit` this comment used to contrast
    it against dropped MultiEdit on a false premise (`_entry_identity` keys on matcher +
    EVERY command, so spec_gate's group coexists with the worktree_gate group under the
    same matcher) — and the Cursor template still carried that mistake, which meant a
    Cursor user's MultiEdit writes were not spec-gated at all. Aligned 2026-08-14
    (PLAN-render-degrades-live-harness); the two files must now agree, and the divergence
    this comment described no longer exists.
    Every PreToolUse blocking gate carries `"timeout": 10`, matching its siblings.
    permission_gate takes `--subordinate-to-deny-dangerous` (ADR-007) — Claude-only, so the
    gate defers to this file's `permissions.deny` for the deny_dangerous opt-out.

    ADR-010: `sessionstart_drift` is deliberately absent — the plugin bundle
    (`hooks/hooks.json` at plugin root) already fires it; rendering it here too
    would double-register it for plugin users.

    Schema is Claude's: PascalCase event keys + nested {matcher?, hooks:[...]}.
    Cursor (.cursor/hooks.json) and Codex (.codex/hooks.json) own their own files
    with their own schemas — do NOT collapse them into this one.
-#}
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": ["Read", "Bash(uv run --with {{ harness_maker_src_path }} python -m harness_maker.*)", "Bash(uv run --with {{ harness_maker_src_path }} hm *)", "Bash(uv run pytest:*)", "Bash(uv run ruff:*)", "Bash(uv run mypy:*)", "Bash(pytest:*)", "Bash(git:*)"{% if config.second_opinion and config.second_opinion.models %}, "Bash(uv run --with {{ harness_maker_src_path }} hm second_opinion_invoke:*)"{% endif %}{% if config.second_opinion and 'codex' in config.second_opinion.models %}, "Bash(codex exec:*)"{% endif %}{% if config.second_opinion and 'antigravity' in config.second_opinion.models %}, "Bash(agy --sandbox --print:*)"{% endif %}],
    "deny": {% if config.permissions.deny_dangerous %}["Bash(rm:*)", "Edit(/etc/**)", "Edit(~/.ssh/**)", "Edit(~/.aws/**)"]{% else %}[]{% endif %}
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.telemetry", "timeout": 5}
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.hooks.post_write_reminder", "timeout": 5}
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.gates.permission_gate --subordinate-to-deny-dangerous", "timeout": 10}
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.gates.worktree_gate", "timeout": 10}
        ]
      }{% if config.dev_mode == "spec-driven" %},
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.gates.spec_gate", "timeout": 10}
        ]
      }{% endif %}
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.hooks.loop_gate --mode stop-hook", "timeout": 10},
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.worktree span-end", "timeout": 10}
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "auto",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.hooks.flush_session", "timeout": 30, "statusMessage": "Snapshotting autoloop progress..."},
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.worktree span-end", "timeout": 10}
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "manual",
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.hooks.flush_session", "timeout": 30, "statusMessage": "Snapshotting autoloop progress..."},
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.worktree span-end", "timeout": 10}
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.hooks.sessionid_envfile"},
          {"type": "command", "command": "uv run --with \"{{ harness_maker_src_path }}\" python -m harness_maker.hooks.autopilot_autoarm"}
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "preset": "{{ preset }}"
}
